<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>極速撩妹 - 雲端版</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        body { background-color: #050505; }
        .gold-border { border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3); }
        .glitter-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f0f 0%, #1a1a1a 100%); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-gray-100 select-none">
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col p-4">
        <header class="text-center py-6">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-500 tracking-widest">極速撩妹技巧</h1>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2">最強聊天話術庫</p>
        </header>

        <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="glitter-bg gold-border p-4 rounded-xl">
                <h2 class="text-yellow-400 font-bold mb-2">🔥 開場白專區</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-300">「你有地圖嗎？我在你的眼神裡迷路了。」</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="glitter-bg gold-border p-4 rounded-xl">
                <h2 class="text-yellow-400 font-bold mb-2">💎 幽默回話</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-300">「我不吃甜點，因為你已經夠甜了。」</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto py-6 text-center text-gray-600 text-xs">
            © 2026 極速撩妹技巧 - 雲端即時版
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
